sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    A->>B: hello
    Note over A,B: greeting
    loop retry until ack
        B-->>A: ack?
        alt got ack
            A->>B: yes
        else
            A-)B: nope
        end
    end
    B->>C: forward
    C--xB: failed
    C->>C: self check
